<title>USA: W.R. Grace names Akers to board.</title>
<headline>W.R. Grace names Akers to board.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>W.R. Grace &amp; Co said it has elected former International Business Machines Corp chairman John Akers to its board of directors.</p>
<p>Akers served as chairman and chief executive officer of IBM from 1985 until 1993, when he retired after a 33-year career.</p>
<p>&quot;We are pleased to welcome John Akers to the Grace board, especially in view of his broad international management and marketing experience,&quot; said Albert Costello, Grace's chairman. The addition brings the total number of directors on the Grace board to nine.</p>
</text>
